  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Book donation Project in Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the current economic imbalances in the country, the prices of goods in the country have increased rapidly, but there has not been a corresponding increase in wages and it has put a lot of pressure on people&apos;s lives. In such a situation, not being able to carry out educational activities has had various effects on the lives of the sons and daughters who are in the country. The aim of this project is to provide a set of school equipment needed for  the next school term for 500 students</narrative>
  </description>
